+    "note": "Conserved co-moving Gram matrix and exact force-canceling sector; fixed-norm Gauss-admissible nonlinear departure on O(1/epsilon) time. Six positive t=a*kappa/r values remain open. 42 exact algebra checks, three numerical campaigns. Action unchanged; physical promotion 0.",
